id: pm-t3jxjj
title: Adopt Sentry 11 after release-age and telemetry compatibility proof
description: "Sentry Node 11.0.0 was published September 23, 2026 and is below the seven-day repository adoption window on September 27. After eligibility, validate SDK API compatibility, strict static and exact coverage gates, packed Node 22/24/26 consumers, Sentry event classification, telemetry delivery, and rollback before adopting the major."
type: Chore
status: open
priority: 3
tags[3]: dependencies,sentry,telemetry
created_at: "2026-09-27T21:20:34.332Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-14T04:36:58.188Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: "Revalidate the exact upstream publication timestamp and seven-day cooldown before choosing an eligible Sentry 11 version; Demonstrate Node 22/24/26 installed-consumer compatibility, telemetry delivery and expected-error classification with positive and negative controls; Pass static, exact coverage and release gates and document rollback to the prior supported major without losing queued telemetry"
parent: pm-doxj
risk: high
confidence: medium
expected_result: "Adopt an eligible Sentry 11 release only after public SDK, supported Node consumers and telemetry acceptance prove compatibility."
